<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

<main class="main-content">
  <!-- About Hero -->
  <section style="padding: 4rem 0 2rem; background-color: var(--bg-white); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 860px;">
      <span class="section-label">Our Model</span>
      <h1 class="editorial-heading" style="font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.15;">
        Redefining fashion consumption through closed-loop circularity.
      </h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        Revé is built on a straightforward thesis: the cleanest garment is the one that already exists. By combining an Amazon-grade circular marketplace with a dual-value digital token wallet, we make keeping garments in circulation more rewarding than discarding them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container" style="padding: 4rem 0 6rem; max-width: 860px;">
    <!-- Section 1: The Dual-Value Token Economy -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Section 01</span>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        The Dual-Value Token Architecture
      </h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
        Traditional resale platforms let value easily bleed out into cash, creating friction and incentivizing linear transactional behavior. Revé introduces a closed-loop platform credit denominated in <strong>Revé Tokens (RT)</strong>:
      </p>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0;">
        <div class="card-white" style="border-color: var(--token-green);">
          <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--token-green); letter-spacing: 0.08em;">
            Inside the Marketplace
          </span>
          <div style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--token-green-dark); margin: 0.5rem 0;">
            1 RT = $1.00 Value (1:1)
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
            Every token holds full, non-diluted value when used to purchase verified clothing listings inside Revé. 100 tokens purchase $100 worth of clothing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-white">
          <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); letter-spacing: 0.08em;">
            Cashing Out to Fiat
          </span>
          <div style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); margin: 0.5rem 0;">
            20% Conversion Deduction
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; margin: 0;">
            Users remain free to withdraw tokens as real cash anytime, but incurring a 20% deduction preserves community liquidity and finances circular sorting.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2: Three Core Journeys -->
    <div style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Section 02</span>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        The Three Core Pillars of Revé
      </h2>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem;">
        <div class="card-white" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            1. Verified Circular Marketplace
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            Every piece on Revé is ozone sanitized, verified for fiber integrity, measured, and cataloged with clear condition scores. Detailed metrics showcase exact liters of water conserved and kilograms of CO2 avoided.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-white" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            2. Wardrobe Trade-In with Instant Valuation
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            Users submit details of items they no longer wear. Our algorithm evaluates the brand tier, category, and condition, presenting an immediate token offer. Accepted offers are instantly credited to the user's digital wallet.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-white" style="padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
            3. Zero-Landfill Textile Donation
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
            For garments too worn to be resold, users generate free prepaid donation passes. Items are directed toward community emergency shelter drives, repair workshops, or mechanical fiber-level shredding for insulation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: flex-start; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);">
      <a href="/marketplace" class="btn btn-primary">Start Browsing Marketplace &rarr;</a>
      <a href="/wallet" class="btn btn-secondary">Explore Token Wallet</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
